### T3-Payruns — Scenario Validation & Reports
### Prerequisite: T1-Bootstrap must be completed first
###
### NOTE: Live payrun execution (monthly/biweekly/weekly jobs) is done via
###       WebApp or REST API — there is no pecmd PayrunJobStart command.
###       This script validates specific scenarios with PayrunEmployeePreviewTest
###       and generates reports from completed payrun data.

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 1 — January baseline (re-run T1 tests as preview for quick check)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sara: Monthly, company car + 401k + W-4 adjustments
PayrunEmployeePreviewTest ../Tests/DEMO-TC01-US-Sara-Monthly/DEMO-TC01-US-Sara-Monthly.et.json /TestPrecision2

# Jessica: TX no-SIT baseline
PayrunEmployeePreviewTest ../Tests/DEMO-TC05-US-Jessica-TX/DEMO-TC05-US-Jessica-TX.et.json /TestPrecision2

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 2 — March: Jessica $10,000 performance bonus (supplemental wages)
###   Step 1: import bonus case value (period-scoped, March biweekly)
###   Step 2: run preview — observe WT 1100 + flat 22% FIT component
###           /OkOnFail because payrollResults are empty (no assertions yet)
###           Capture actual results with ActualOutputFile for later assertion
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PayrollImport Scenarios/March-Bonus-Jessica.json
PayrunEmployeePreviewTest Scenarios/March-Bonus-Preview.et.json /showall /OkOnFail ActualOutputFile:Scenarios/March-Bonus.actual.json

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Reports — prerequisite: payruns for the target period must be complete
### Run from repo root (paths relative to T3-Payruns)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Payslip — Sara Chen, January 2026 (Monthly payroll)
Report tenant:Apex.DigitalSolutions user:apex.admin@apexdigital.com regulation:US.Payroll report:US.Payslip culture:en-US parameterFile:Reports/Payslip-Sara-January.parameters.json /pdf /shellopen

### Payslip — Jessica Torres, March 2026 (Biweekly, includes bonus)
Report tenant:Apex.DigitalSolutions user:apex.admin@apexdigital.com regulation:US.Payroll report:US.Payslip culture:en-US parameterFile:Reports/Payslip-Jessica-March.parameters.json /pdf /shellopen

